  ("How much does a Rinnai tankless water heater cost installed in Ontario?", "A Rinnai tankless water heater installed by EHI starts at $3,300 for the RX160iN, with the RX199iN, recirculation and gas line upgrades quoted individually. Installed pricing depends on size and installation requirements, and every quote is guaranteed before work starts."),
  ("Should I choose the Rinnai RX160iN or RX199iN?", "Choose the RX160iN, at up to about 9 GPM, for most homes with one or two bathrooms, and the RX199iN, at up to about 11.1 GPM, for larger families and homes with three or more bathrooms that run showers at the same time. We size by fixture count and Ontario's cold incoming water temperature, which lowers winter flow on any tankless."),
